(4395885, 632091, 22390, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. The shape of the building is really surprising. The light is nice too.</td>', 'Interesting picture. The shape of the building is really surprising. The light is nice too.', '2008-01-16 05:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
