(4396109, 632293, 74979, '<td valign="top">great clarity &amp; well seen colors;  this conveys the wall''s story to me more than that of the bldg it surrounds</td>', 'great clarity & well seen colors;  this conveys the wall''s story to me more than that of the bldg it surrounds', '2008-01-16 07:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396115, 631001, 74979, '<td valign="top">intersting image, would like more details of thhe bldg however.  lovely sky and I like how you handled the clors in the scrub around the shack</td>', 'intersting image, would like more details of thhe bldg however.  lovely sky and I like how you handled the clors in the scrub around the shack', '2008-01-16 07:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396118, 631893, 74979, '<td valign="top">most impressive in its demise eh?  This must have been an amazing place in its day</td>', 'most impressive in its demise eh?  This must have been an amazing place in its day', '2008-01-16 07:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396121, 633804, 74979, '<td valign="top">the PP is great but feels too fresh &amp; new in contrast to the subject, for me this takes away from any sense of abandonment</td>', 'the PP is great but feels too fresh & new in contrast to the subject, for me this takes away from any sense of abandonment', '2008-01-16 07:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396125, 632554, 74979, '<td valign="top">lots of textures to this image, muted color contribute to the sense of abandonment</td>', 'lots of textures to this image, muted color contribute to the sense of abandonment', '2008-01-16 08:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396227, 632221, 36006, '<td valign="top">I am not convinced that this building is actually abandoned.</td>', 'I am not convinced that this building is actually abandoned.', '2008-01-16 08:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396242, 633083, 87538, '<td valign="top">Could you use more unsharp mask?</td>', 'Could you use more unsharp mask?', '2008-01-16 08:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396250, 631661, 87538, '<td valign="top">Poor composition. while I appreciate including the fence in the photo, you would have been better served to move the lens a bit to the right placing the fence off to the left more, revealing the boarded up doorway and taking the no trespassing sign out of the center.</td>', 'Poor composition. while I appreciate including the fence in the photo, you would have been better served to move the lens a bit to the right placing the fence off to the left more, revealing the boarded up doorway and taking the no trespassing sign out of the center.', '2008-01-16 08:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396254, 633434, 87538, '<td valign="top">Too Bright</td>', 'Too Bright', '2008-01-16 08:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396258, 632655, 87538, '<td valign="top">Backlighting is always an issue. You failed to resolve it here.</td>', 'Backlighting is always an issue. You failed to resolve it here.', '2008-01-16 08:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396265, 632554, 87538, '<td valign="top">I like to composition, however the image feels oversaturated. The power of each color is unbalanced in comparison to its neighbor.</td>', 'I like to composition, however the image feels oversaturated. The power of each color is unbalanced in comparison to its neighbor.', '2008-01-16 09:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396269, 633815, 87538, '<td valign="top">Please tell me where I can find a sky like the one in this photo.</td>', 'Please tell me where I can find a sky like the one in this photo.', '2008-01-16 09:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396272, 633677, 87538, '<td valign="top">Is that your shadow in the foreground of the photo?</td>', 'Is that your shadow in the foreground of the photo?', '2008-01-16 09:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396276, 631786, 87538, '<td valign="top">Something says to me this could have been better.</td>', 'Something says to me this could have been better.', '2008-01-16 09:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396279, 632889, 88479, '<td valign="top">I love the texture and grittiness of the stairs and peeling paintwork, but I find the brightness of the windows distracting.</td>', 'I love the texture and grittiness of the stairs and peeling paintwork, but I find the brightness of the windows distracting.', '2008-01-16 09:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396309, 633780, 87538, '<td valign="top">the sky is blown out...the vignetting is very distracting and the bulk of the photo is out of focus.</td>', 'the sky is blown out...the vignetting is very distracting and the bulk of the photo is out of focus.', '2008-01-16 09:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396313, 633232, 87538, '<td valign="top">How does this qualify?  The building is obviously in use.</td>', 'How does this qualify?  The building is obviously in use.', '2008-01-16 09:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396314, 632111, 87538, '<td valign="top">Is there some reason to oversaturate a photo into the unnatural. this might have looked fantastic as a black and white.</td>', 'Is there some reason to oversaturate a photo into the unnatural. this might have looked fantastic as a black and white.', '2008-01-16 09:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396325, 633881, 87538, '<td valign="top">For my own personal tastes, if you are going to blur the foreground, keep the amount of foreground to a minimum. The blurred leaves and flowers is a distraction.</td>', 'For my own personal tastes, if you are going to blur the foreground, keep the amount of foreground to a minimum. The blurred leaves and flowers is a distraction.', '2008-01-16 09:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396333, 632683, 87538, '<td valign="top">The false coloring made me ill.</td>', 'The false coloring made me ill.', '2008-01-16 09:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396338, 633416, 87538, '<td valign="top">You would have gotten more from me if you had shown me just a tad deeper colors.</td>', 'You would have gotten more from me if you had shown me just a tad deeper colors.', '2008-01-16 09:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396344, 632919, 87538, '<td valign="top">Too much sky, imo</td>', 'Too much sky, imo', '2008-01-16 09:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396345, 633733, 88010, '<td valign="top">Quite nice but the more modern plastic jug takes away a bit from the general feel of this pic.</td>', 'Quite nice but the more modern plastic jug takes away a bit from the general feel of this pic.', '2008-01-16 09:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396348, 631893, 88010, '<td valign="top">Rather blurry.</td>', 'Rather blurry.', '2008-01-16 09:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396351, 633322, 58618, '<td valign="top">this looks like a construction site over an abandoned building.. nice lighting though</td>', 'this looks like a construction site over an abandoned building.. nice lighting though', '2008-01-16 09:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396364, 632111, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very blurry</td>', 'Very blurry', '2008-01-16 09:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396365, 633376, 58618, '<td valign="top">great building on the canal! a classic in griffintown.</td>', 'great building on the canal! a classic in griffintown.', '2008-01-16 09:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396369, 633156, 51269, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well- would like to see more of the surrounding landscape to minimize that glaring roof !</td>', 'Meets the challenge well- would like to see more of the surrounding landscape to minimize that glaring roof !', '2008-01-16 09:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396373, 632738, 51269, '<td valign="top">Brilliant !</td>', 'Brilliant !', '2008-01-16 09:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396382, 633677, 88010, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out the bright light on the right. As it is here, it pulls the eye toward it and away from the building.</td>', 'I would have cropped out the bright light on the right. As it is here, it pulls the eye toward it and away from the building.', '2008-01-16 09:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396386, 633526, 80912, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but I wish the DoF was larger - to allow some details of the pipe. And the slight tilt will probably lose you some points w/ voters as well.</td>', 'Cool idea, but I wish the DoF was larger - to allow some details of the pipe. And the slight tilt will probably lose you some points w/ voters as well.', '2008-01-16 09:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396388, 633110, 80912, '<td valign="top">The greenish tone ruins it for me, and it may just be the slope of the ground, but I feel like the whole picture is tipping to the left.</td>', 'The greenish tone ruins it for me, and it may just be the slope of the ground, but I feel like the whole picture is tipping to the left.', '2008-01-16 10:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396391, 632201, 80912, '<td valign="top">I love the windows and the light, but the crop seems off - too much on top? not enough on the bottom? maybe it would look better if you lost the window on the right?</td>', 'I love the windows and the light, but the crop seems off - too much on top? not enough on the bottom? maybe it would look better if you lost the window on the right?', '2008-01-16 10:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396393, 633220, 80912, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more contrast</td>', 'Needs a bit more contrast', '2008-01-16 10:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396402, 633804, 80912, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit oversaturated, especially the brick on the right (and the red on the next building), but I really like the composition.</td>', 'Seems a bit oversaturated, especially the brick on the right (and the red on the next building), but I really like the composition.', '2008-01-16 10:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396408, 633712, 80912, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been more dramatic w/out the woman.</td>', 'I think it would have been more dramatic w/out the woman.', '2008-01-16 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396414, 632221, 80912, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but thsi looks like a real estate ad, not an abandonded building!(And the upper flor seem a bit blown out on the right.)</td>', 'I like the composition, but thsi looks like a real estate ad, not an abandonded building!(And the upper flor seem a bit blown out on the right.)', '2008-01-16 10:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396430, 633918, 88838, '<td valign="top">nice contrast, nicely composed</td>', 'nice contrast, nicely composed', '2008-01-16 10:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396432, 633154, 88838, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the caption--couldn''t it be "Farmer''s Ineptitude, So Future Subdivision"? But well-framed and nicely stark.</td>', 'Not sure I like the caption--couldn''t it be "Farmer''s Ineptitude, So Future Subdivision"? But well-framed and nicely stark.', '2008-01-16 10:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396434, 632578, 88838, '<td valign="top">Not easy to see abandonment here. It''s a nice winter scene, but we don''t see that this is an abandoned building.</td>', 'Not easy to see abandonment here. It''s a nice winter scene, but we don''t see that this is an abandoned building.', '2008-01-16 10:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396439, 633425, 88838, '<td valign="top">Looks like Kreuzberg Castle near Idar-Oberstein. If so, I''ve enjoyed drinking beer on top of it before.</td>', 'Looks like Kreuzberg Castle near Idar-Oberstein. If so, I''ve enjoyed drinking beer on top of it before.', '2008-01-16 10:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396467, 631248, 35014, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and texture of the building.  I would have considered moving closer to the window to leave out the sky and ground.  And complemented the window with a landscape crop instead of a portrait crop.  Very close to a great shot.</td>', 'Nice framing and texture of the building.  I would have considered moving closer to the window to leave out the sky and ground.  And complemented the window with a landscape crop instead of a portrait crop.  Very close to a great shot.', '2008-01-16 10:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396475, 633182, 35014, '<td valign="top">Great shot; I like the subtleness of the night sky and this smooth gradients. How was the building itself Illuminated?</td>', 'Great shot; I like the subtleness of the night sky and this smooth gradients. How was the building itself Illuminated?', '2008-01-16 10:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396478, 633451, 35014, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and colors.  One of my favs so far.  How wide was your lens?</td>', 'Very nice composition and colors.  One of my favs so far.  How wide was your lens?', '2008-01-16 10:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396486, 632924, 89077, '<td valign="top">great rust colours. does not look abandoned though.</td>', 'great rust colours. does not look abandoned though.', '2008-01-16 10:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396487, 633316, 35014, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sky makes the photo; not sure about the duotone color. Maybe a bluish hue would do better, or at least have a cooler feel to match the photo. It still ranks on the higher side for me.  Nice job.</td>', 'Dramatic sky makes the photo; not sure about the duotone color. Maybe a bluish hue would do better, or at least have a cooler feel to match the photo. It still ranks on the higher side for me.  Nice job.', '2008-01-16 10:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396491, 631646, 89077, '<td valign="top">Is it really abandoned? incredible sky though.</td>', 'Is it really abandoned? incredible sky though.', '2008-01-16 10:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396499, 631939, 35014, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and color, add a bit of luck with the rainbow and you have a great shot.  A bit too soft for me I would have tried a little usm to sharpen it up a bit.</td>', 'Very nice composition and color, add a bit of luck with the rainbow and you have a great shot.  A bit too soft for me I would have tried a little usm to sharpen it up a bit.', '2008-01-16 10:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396505, 633562, 18073, '<td valign="top">Looks a little under exposed to me, and while this does add to the atmosphere and shows the textures off, it does mean a lack of detail in the shutters.  Great choice of subject matter though I am not sure about the composition, it looks a little tight to me.  Perhaps a close up of the door or the lower right window with the remnants of the shutter would have been an option?<br/> <br/>Love the colour in this image though and the textures are fab.  Good effort!</td>', 'Looks a little under exposed to me, and while this does add to the atmosphere and shows the textures off, it does mean a lack of detail in the shutters.  Great choice of subject matter though I am not sure about the composition, it looks a little tight to me.  Perhaps a close up of the door or the lower right window with the remnants of the shutter would have been an option? Love the colour in this image though and the textures are fab.  Good effort!', '2008-01-16 10:52:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4396506, 633662, 35014, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great shot. I would like to see the buildings a bit closer if you are still able to fit in the mountains, sky, and stream.  I guess the widest lens possible makes or breaks the photo.  And maybe a bit more noise reduction. These are just small points that may or may not help.  Great shot.  Highest rating so far.</td>', 'Wow! Great shot. I would like to see the buildings a bit closer if you are still able to fit in the mountains, sky, and stream.  I guess the widest lens possible makes or breaks the photo.  And maybe a bit more noise reduction. These are just small points that may or may not help.  Great shot.  Highest rating so far.', '2008-01-16 10:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396531, 632738, 72070, '<td valign="top">really great sky, but the halo around the barn is way to visible to seem natural ... but other than that a fantastic shot!</td>', 'really great sky, but the halo around the barn is way to visible to seem natural ... but other than that a fantastic shot!', '2008-01-16 11:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396532, 632228, 18073, '<td valign="top">I think you were asking a lot of your camera by trying to expose for this image.  While trying to expose for the subject it has blown all the highlights in the shrubland.  I am not sure what you could hav edone to avoid this with the basic editing rules, but perhaps you could have tried shooting at a different time of day when the sunlight wasn''t as strong or shooting on a cloudy day?<br/> <br/>You have spotted a good subject to shoot though, the little house is nice and I am sure you could get a really good shot out of it.</td>', 'I think you were asking a lot of your camera by trying to expose for this image.  While trying to expose for the subject it has blown all the highlights in the shrubland.  I am not sure what you could hav edone to avoid this with the basic editing rules, but perhaps you could have tried shooting at a different time of day when the sunlight wasn''t as strong or shooting on a cloudy day? You have spotted a good subject to shoot though, the little house is nice and I am sure you could get a really good shot out of it.', '2008-01-16 11:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396544, 632228, 35014, '<td valign="top">The infraRed works well here,  nice textures and comp except for something in the foreground on the left edge.  Nice job.</td>', 'The infraRed works well here,  nice textures and comp except for something in the foreground on the left edge.  Nice job.', '2008-01-16 11:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396545, 633810, 80534, '<td valign="top">I love the look and feel of the photo.  I noticed the bricked windows and their outlines.  Photo makes for a quite interesting conversation and peaks my interest with questions about its history.</td>', 'I love the look and feel of the photo.  I noticed the bricked windows and their outlines.  Photo makes for a quite interesting conversation and peaks my interest with questions about its history.', '2008-01-16 11:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396547, 633220, 18073, '<td valign="top">This is a great building and a brilliant choice for you to shoot.  For me though, you have missed an opportunity here.  I think shooting earlier or later in the day would have given some moody lighting and perhaps a lower viewpoint could have helped with the composition.</td>', 'This is a great building and a brilliant choice for you to shoot.  For me though, you have missed an opportunity here.  I think shooting earlier or later in the day would have given some moody lighting and perhaps a lower viewpoint could have helped with the composition.', '2008-01-16 11:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396554, 633632, 35014, '<td valign="top">I recognize this from he 1st Abandoned Buildings challenge.  I''m sorry to say that the 1st one was the better one. The night sky, reflecting water, and glowing lights of the 1st made the photo.  This one lacks in those points but it still an interesting photo.</td>', 'I recognize this from he 1st Abandoned Buildings challenge.  I''m sorry to say that the 1st one was the better one. The night sky, reflecting water, and glowing lights of the 1st made the photo.  This one lacks in those points but it still an interesting photo.', '2008-01-16 11:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396557, 633662, 72070, '<td valign="top">amazing landscape around this building ... the lead in line created by the river makes the shot dynamic... a really good entry!</td>', 'amazing landscape around this building ... the lead in line created by the river makes the shot dynamic... a really good entry!', '2008-01-16 11:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396558, 633635, 35014, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, try bumping up the contrast a little more would create a more striking photo.</td>', 'Nice photo, try bumping up the contrast a little more would create a more striking photo.', '2008-01-16 11:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396560, 631947, 35014, '<td valign="top">Too busy, no real focal point.</td>', 'Too busy, no real focal point.', '2008-01-16 11:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396565, 633644, 72070, '<td valign="top">nice point of view! I really like how the eye is dramn down to the barn!</td>', 'nice point of view! I really like how the eye is dramn down to the barn!', '2008-01-16 11:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396571, 631526, 72070, '<td valign="top">nice angle !! I really like the composition!</td>', 'nice angle !! I really like the composition!', '2008-01-16 11:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396597, 633562, 72070, '<td valign="top">nice colours and textures! they make for a very moody image!</td>', 'nice colours and textures! they make for a very moody image!', '2008-01-16 11:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4396608, 631248, 34041, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Sadly the white space at the top detracts from the image, IMO it would be a much better shot if that was cropped out - 6  as it is.</td>', 'Great idea.  Sadly the white space at the top detracts from the image, IMO it would be a much better shot if that was cropped out - 6  as it is.', '2008-01-16 11:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
