(4397261, 633954, 80798, '<td valign="top">I like the building. I think this might be better if the building to the left and the cars to the right were cropped out.</td>', 'I like the building. I think this might be better if the building to the left and the cars to the right were cropped out.', '2008-01-16 14:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397264, 633316, 44611, '<td valign="top">I am intrigued as to how you got the sky like that - hope you will let us know once voting is over.  The sky definitely makes this shot.</td>', 'I am intrigued as to how you got the sky like that - hope you will let us know once voting is over.  The sky definitely makes this shot.', '2008-01-16 14:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397269, 631707, 44611, '<td valign="top">This would have been terrific if you had cropped it closer on the left - and perhaps the perspective needing some adjustment.  Great idea and interesting buildings.</td>', 'This would have been terrific if you had cropped it closer on the left - and perhaps the perspective needing some adjustment.  Great idea and interesting buildings.', '2008-01-16 14:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397271, 631109, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely and simple and meets the challenge.  Good composition.  A bit more interest in the sky would have made this perfect.</td>', 'Lovely and simple and meets the challenge.  Good composition.  A bit more interest in the sky would have made this perfect.', '2008-01-16 14:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397272, 632559, 44611, '<td valign="top">Fab - but how do you get that wondrous grungy look in basic editing?  Please, please let us know when voting is over.</td>', 'Fab - but how do you get that wondrous grungy look in basic editing?  Please, please let us know when voting is over.', '2008-01-16 14:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397275, 631001, 44611, '<td valign="top">Shame about the oof foreground, it is very distracting.</td>', 'Shame about the oof foreground, it is very distracting.', '2008-01-16 14:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397281, 631327, 44611, '<td valign="top">This looks like a wonderful setting but the contrast and depth of colour in this shot doesn''t really bring out the atmosphere as much as I would like to see.</td>', 'This looks like a wonderful setting but the contrast and depth of colour in this shot doesn''t really bring out the atmosphere as much as I would like to see.', '2008-01-16 14:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397282, 632062, 44611, '<td valign="top">Very soft focus although the overall concept is good.</td>', 'Very soft focus although the overall concept is good.', '2008-01-16 14:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397284, 631646, 35014, '<td valign="top">The sky makes the photo and the whole frame has nice tonal range.<br/>WEll Done!</td>', 'The sky makes the photo and the whole frame has nice tonal range.WEll Done!', '2008-01-16 14:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397285, 632111, 44611, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too contrasty for me - the greens are far, far too bright.</td>', 'Just a bit too contrasty for me - the greens are far, far too bright.', '2008-01-16 14:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397296, 633189, 44611, '<td valign="top">With a bit more ''pop'' this could have been brilliant.  It''s interesting and fits the challenge but just comes across as a tad dull.</td>', 'With a bit more ''pop'' this could have been brilliant.  It''s interesting and fits the challenge but just comes across as a tad dull.', '2008-01-16 14:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397298, 633517, 44611, '<td valign="top">Those hedges are so well trimmed I find it hard to believe this is an abandoned building?</td>', 'Those hedges are so well trimmed I find it hard to believe this is an abandoned building?', '2008-01-16 14:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397301, 633835, 2553, '<td valign="top">I see some interest in the image, but not close up enough, just too much foreground taking away from the more interesting stuff.  Personal preference perhaps, but I am not really comfortable with the skewed angle of the image.</td>', 'I see some interest in the image, but not close up enough, just too much foreground taking away from the more interesting stuff.  Personal preference perhaps, but I am not really comfortable with the skewed angle of the image.', '2008-01-16 14:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397302, 633709, 44611, '<td valign="top">I wish this was straighter - the off kilter angle is a bit off putting which is a shame because the colours and feel of the shot are great.</td>', 'I wish this was straighter - the off kilter angle is a bit off putting which is a shame because the colours and feel of the shot are great.', '2008-01-16 14:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397311, 632667, 44611, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame the overall focus on this is soft ... there are some fabulous colours and textures lurking in this old brickwork and it would have been nice to see greater detail and contrast.</td>', 'It''s a shame the overall focus on this is soft ... there are some fabulous colours and textures lurking in this old brickwork and it would have been nice to see greater detail and contrast.', '2008-01-16 14:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397318, 633131, 44611, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this comes across far too much like a rushed snapshot.  I am sure this building is fascinating, and there are other angles from which you could have taken your photo which would have made it more of a feature.  As it is the eye is drawn to the mass of foliage in the foreground which is very distracting.</td>', 'Sorry but this comes across far too much like a rushed snapshot.  I am sure this building is fascinating, and there are other angles from which you could have taken your photo which would have made it more of a feature.  As it is the eye is drawn to the mass of foliage in the foreground which is very distracting.', '2008-01-16 14:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4397321, 632559, 80798, '<td valign="top">Lots of junk. I love it!</td>', 'Lots of junk. I love it!', '2008-01-16 14:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
