(4399645, 633878, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is really an excellent shot.  That said, I find the building and the dog competing for my "eye''s attention".  That is, it seems you have two subjects with no clear indication of where my eye should be drawn.<br/> <br/>This is a pretty minor "criticism" however.  Bottom line is that this is a really good shot.</td>', 'This is really an excellent shot.  That said, I find the building and the dog competing for my "eye''s attention".  That is, it seems you have two subjects with no clear indication of where my eye should be drawn. This is a pretty minor "criticism" however.  Bottom line is that this is a really good shot.', '2008-01-17 10:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
