(4399654, 633316, 39679, '<td valign="top">Wow...what a great shot.  IMHO, a ribbon for sure.  There''s a lot of drama  here in the clouds but also in the perspective that you''ve chosen for the building.  Additionally, your decision to use monochrome was absolutely the right one.  I think that color would have detracted from the wonderful textures.  Great job!</td>', 'Wow...what a great shot.  IMHO, a ribbon for sure.  There''s a lot of drama  here in the clouds but also in the perspective that you''ve chosen for the building.  Additionally, your decision to use monochrome was absolutely the right one.  I think that color would have detracted from the wonderful textures.  Great job!', '2008-01-17 10:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399657, 632208, 23433, '<td valign="top">Funny how the satellite dish is on this old beat up place.</td>', 'Funny how the satellite dish is on this old beat up place.', '2008-01-17 10:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399661, 633366, 42171, '<td valign="top">Really like this. Those spooky looking trees surrounding that haunted house - Could be a movie set from a B&amp;W horror flick!</td>', 'Really like this. Those spooky looking trees surrounding that haunted house - Could be a movie set from a B&W horror flick!', '2008-01-17 10:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399663, 633559, 39679, '<td valign="top">I''ve always found that digital B&amp;W just doesn''t have the "feel" of film but you''ve done a wonderful job of getting really close.  The density you''ve achieved is striking.  The sky is very dramatic and serves as an interesting backdrop for your subject.<br/> <br/>It''s a pleasure to judge images like this.  Thanks!</td>', 'I''ve always found that digital B&W just doesn''t have the "feel" of film but you''ve done a wonderful job of getting really close.  The density you''ve achieved is striking.  The sky is very dramatic and serves as an interesting backdrop for your subject. It''s a pleasure to judge images like this.  Thanks!', '2008-01-17 10:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399665, 632964, 42171, '<td valign="top">This looks nice. The "Yellow" approach could have wangled it into the other challenge too!<br/> <br/>Nicely composed - Leads the eye right down the stairs! 8</td>', 'This looks nice. The "Yellow" approach could have wangled it into the other challenge too! Nicely composed - Leads the eye right down the stairs! 8', '2008-01-17 10:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399666, 631001, 39679, '<td valign="top">What a cool shot.  Without looking cheesy, you''ve really managed to capture the sense of moving in a car while keeping camera shake way down.  I''d really like to see more density and color in the sky however.  I think that would really have made this an even better shot.</td>', 'What a cool shot.  Without looking cheesy, you''ve really managed to capture the sense of moving in a car while keeping camera shake way down.  I''d really like to see more density and color in the sky however.  I think that would really have made this an even better shot.', '2008-01-17 10:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399669, 631238, 42171, '<td valign="top">Cool looking building - Shot looks a bit fuzzy though?</td>', 'Cool looking building - Shot looks a bit fuzzy though?', '2008-01-17 10:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399670, 632091, 39679, '<td valign="top">I would normally have said that this image was overexposed but, in this instance, it works well.  The image, being so bright, has the feel of infrared but not too surrealistic.  While you''ve lost some detail in the clouds on the left, the detail of the building is nice.</td>', 'I would normally have said that this image was overexposed but, in this instance, it works well.  The image, being so bright, has the feel of infrared but not too surrealistic.  While you''ve lost some detail in the clouds on the left, the detail of the building is nice.', '2008-01-17 10:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399672, 632673, 23433, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the detail is great. The contrast makes it look very clean.</td>', 'Nice shot, the detail is great. The contrast makes it look very clean.', '2008-01-17 10:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399673, 633131, 23433, '<td valign="top">Out of focus</td>', 'Out of focus', '2008-01-17 10:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399677, 633712, 42171, '<td valign="top">Hmmm - This one is tricky...<br/> <br/>The house is awesome. The angle you have shot it at is very appealing, with the three apex''s of the roof all visible.<br/> <br/>I wished I could use the Skew tool to correct the converging lines on mine, though they seem to work very well here.<br/> <br/>I like the model in the foreground - I hate that she is blurred and unclear!<br/> <br/>IMO, This image will either do VERY well, or the girl will ruin it for you.<br/>I''ll give a 7.</td>', 'Hmmm - This one is tricky... The house is awesome. The angle you have shot it at is very appealing, with the three apex''s of the roof all visible. I wished I could use the Skew tool to correct the converging lines on mine, though they seem to work very well here. I like the model in the foreground - I hate that she is blurred and unclear! IMO, This image will either do VERY well, or the girl will ruin it for you.I''ll give a 7.', '2008-01-17 11:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399681, 632042, 42171, '<td valign="top">The odd angle here is killing the shot. If you had stood directly in front of the building (Maybe three steps to your right?), it would have worked better.</td>', 'The odd angle here is killing the shot. If you had stood directly in front of the building (Maybe three steps to your right?), it would have worked better.', '2008-01-17 11:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399682, 633149, 23433, '<td valign="top">I like the tree in the foreground. It makes the shot more interesting.</td>', 'I like the tree in the foreground. It makes the shot more interesting.', '2008-01-17 11:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
