(4399688, 633182, 42171, '<td valign="top">Like the dead space. Colour coded border looks nice too (Actually tried this on my own entry though it looked crap!)<br/>Nice sharp subject and the glow from the distance sets it off really well.<br/>How is the house lit up so brightly, yet its surroundings are pitch black?</td>', 'Like the dead space. Colour coded border looks nice too (Actually tried this on my own entry though it looked crap!)Nice sharp subject and the glow from the distance sets it off really well.How is the house lit up so brightly, yet its surroundings are pitch black?', '2008-01-17 11:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399699, 632964, 23433, '<td valign="top">This shot reminds me of a setting for an anti-drug campaign commercials in the early 80''s. Something along the lines "Do you want to Fly little boy" and "Just SAY NO"</td>', 'This shot reminds me of a setting for an anti-drug campaign commercials in the early 80''s. Something along the lines "Do you want to Fly little boy" and "Just SAY NO"', '2008-01-17 11:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4399700, 633451, 42171, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Dorothy!<br/> <br/>Awesome shot! I predict this will be top ten at LEAST, Probably on the front page.<br/> <br/>Lucky with the clouds, having them continue the features through the lower third of the shot. Dead space (Blue Sky) looks great, though the detail of the farm falls on the thirds too! God that rule works every time!<br/> <br/>Nice and sharp throughout - would look awesome in large print.<br/> <br/>The roofs of the distant buildings are the only thing that spiol (term used lightly) the image, though I''m not deducting a point for that!<br/> <br/>10.</td>', 'Nice shot Dorothy! Awesome shot! I predict this will be top ten at LEAST, Probably on the front page. Lucky with the clouds, having them continue the features through the lower third of the shot. Dead space (Blue Sky) looks great, though the detail of the farm falls on the thirds too! God that rule works every time! Nice and sharp throughout - would look awesome in large print. The roofs of the distant buildings are the only thing that spiol (term used lightly) the image, though I''m not deducting a point for that! 10.', '2008-01-17 11:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
