(4402090, 633517, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful building! Lovely photo of it too. It doesn''t look abandoned, even the shrubs look maintained. But I won''t hold that against you.</td>', 'What a beautiful building! Lovely photo of it too. It doesn''t look abandoned, even the shrubs look maintained. But I won''t hold that against you.', '2008-01-18 08:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
