(4402482, 633839, 39679, '<td valign="top">I really like your shot.  In particular I like your choice to "sepiaize" the sky.  With a lack of clouds, adding a subtle color is a brilliant idea to add your own interest to an otherwise bland sky.  A nice side benifit is that it really sets off your subject.<br/> <br/>Nicely done!</td>', 'I really like your shot.  In particular I like your choice to "sepiaize" the sky.  With a lack of clouds, adding a subtle color is a brilliant idea to add your own interest to an otherwise bland sky.  A nice side benifit is that it really sets off your subject. Nicely done!', '2008-01-18 12:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
