(4402740, 633379, 23433, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. This looks like some kind a photo an advertiser would be interested in  Somebody advertising renovation of a building where they provide everything the buyer needs from furniture to interior design. Start with a shot like this and then add a series of shots that shows what kind of improvements they plan to make. Eventually they have a classroom or office where all the space is occupied and used and full of well dressed people.</td>', 'Cool shot. This looks like some kind a photo an advertiser would be interested in  Somebody advertising renovation of a building where they provide everything the buyer needs from furniture to interior design. Start with a shot like this and then add a series of shots that shows what kind of improvements they plan to make. Eventually they have a classroom or office where all the space is occupied and used and full of well dressed people.', '2008-01-18 13:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402744, 632401, 45377, '<td valign="top">An original take on the challenge. Well lit, but I''m not sure I like the black background? Good effort.</td>', 'An original take on the challenge. Well lit, but I''m not sure I like the black background? Good effort.', '2008-01-18 13:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
