(4402753, 631526, 23433, '<td valign="top">Looks like a war zone or something. Cool shot. I like the perspective you used. It looks like you framed up everything real nice, with a small aperture.</td>', 'Looks like a war zone or something. Cool shot. I like the perspective you used. It looks like you framed up everything real nice, with a small aperture.', '2008-01-18 13:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
