(4402776, 631262, 23433, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the sky. I like the colors and contrast. If there was a way to improve I would experiment with the mid-tone levels to see if you can get more detail out of the black object behind the building without losing too much color in the sky.  Not sure if the basic editing rules will allow you to dodge that area or other dark areas to reveal details. Great shot anyway!!</td>', 'Nice capture of the sky. I like the colors and contrast. If there was a way to improve I would experiment with the mid-tone levels to see if you can get more detail out of the black object behind the building without losing too much color in the sky.  Not sure if the basic editing rules will allow you to dodge that area or other dark areas to reveal details. Great shot anyway!!', '2008-01-18 14:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402782, 632901, 23433, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of crop. I wonder what is below that we can''t see.</td>', 'Interesting choice of crop. I wonder what is below that we can''t see.', '2008-01-18 14:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
