(4402867, 633168, 2553, '<td valign="top">Something looks very, very odd about this image.  I mean...it hurts my eyes to look at it.  It almost appears to have been tonemapped.  I would certainly have preferred to see more of the building and less of the surroundings, but perhaps you meant it to be in context.  Except for the eye-piercing moire of the image, I do find the somewhat illustrative look of the image to be appealing.</td>', 'Something looks very, very odd about this image.  I mean...it hurts my eyes to look at it.  It almost appears to have been tonemapped.  I would certainly have preferred to see more of the building and less of the surroundings, but perhaps you meant it to be in context.  Except for the eye-piercing moire of the image, I do find the somewhat illustrative look of the image to be appealing.', '2008-01-18 14:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402868, 631646, 73115, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.', '2008-01-18 14:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
