(4402879, 633379, 86191, '<td valign="top">Wow, GOOD job!  My eyes are drawn right to him.  The colors, the textures, and the subject are all prefect.  =D</td>', 'Wow, GOOD job!  My eyes are drawn right to him.  The colors, the textures, and the subject are all prefect.  =D', '2008-01-18 14:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402881, 632463, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nicely done composition.  The image has a lot of things going on that work together to really draw the eye in.  Simple and effective.</td>', 'Nicely done composition.  The image has a lot of things going on that work together to really draw the eye in.  Simple and effective.', '2008-01-18 14:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402884, 633663, 2553, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!  The leaning gives it a crazy feeling definitely.  Too bad about blown-out sky, but then again, a blue sky may have distracted from the main subject.  Like it a lot.</td>', 'Hilarious!  The leaning gives it a crazy feeling definitely.  Too bad about blown-out sky, but then again, a blue sky may have distracted from the main subject.  Like it a lot.', '2008-01-18 14:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402888, 633517, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m shocked that this building would sit and go to waste!  It''s kind of beautiful in a way.  I like that it looks like a castle.  Very interesting building.  Did you go inside?</td>', 'Wow, I''m shocked that this building would sit and go to waste!  It''s kind of beautiful in a way.  I like that it looks like a castle.  Very interesting building.  Did you go inside?', '2008-01-18 14:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
