(4402896, 633881, 86191, '<td valign="top">My eyes are drawn to the plants and not to the wall, it is very distracting.  The fact that they are blurry bugs me.  The wall itself is very good.  The flowers and vines draping over it adds a great effect.  Good job with finding the wall but next time, focus more on it.</td>', 'My eyes are drawn to the plants and not to the wall, it is very distracting.  The fact that they are blurry bugs me.  The wall itself is very good.  The flowers and vines draping over it adds a great effect.  Good job with finding the wall but next time, focus more on it.', '2008-01-18 14:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402903, 633562, 2553, '<td valign="top">Something about this place/image really caught my attention.  I love the very dark of the windows and verandah against the very earthy color of the wall.  Love the way the bricks are stacked. I like the border too actually.  This is a compelling image for some reason.  Makes me want to know where it is, and what it is.</td>', 'Something about this place/image really caught my attention.  I love the very dark of the windows and verandah against the very earthy color of the wall.  Love the way the bricks are stacked. I like the border too actually.  This is a compelling image for some reason.  Makes me want to know where it is, and what it is.', '2008-01-18 14:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402905, 633559, 86191, '<td valign="top">Good angle and great job with the contrast!  You created a phenomenal picture!</td>', 'Good angle and great job with the contrast!  You created a phenomenal picture!', '2008-01-18 14:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402910, 633083, 86191, '<td valign="top">It looks okay but its to fake looking for my tastes.  Good angle though.</td>', 'It looks okay but its to fake looking for my tastes.  Good angle though.', '2008-01-18 14:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402914, 631327, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely.  It looks like a painting.  Composition is very nice, love the muted tones.</td>', 'This is just lovely.  It looks like a painting.  Composition is very nice, love the muted tones.', '2008-01-18 14:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402919, 633685, 73115, '<td valign="top">The horizon seems a little off.</td>', 'The horizon seems a little off.', '2008-01-18 14:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402923, 633677, 86191, '<td valign="top">Wow! O.O  Great job!  Is that a fire off on the right?  I love the contrast you created by having the moon on the left and a bright light (sort of like the sun) on the left.  The reds and the blues...wow! :] The stars add a cool touch and the house looks amazing!  Exceptional picture!  Maybe next time try to not add so much distracting ground in front of the house.</td>', 'Wow! O.O  Great job!  Is that a fire off on the right?  I love the contrast you created by having the moon on the left and a bright light (sort of like the sun) on the left.  The reds and the blues...wow! :] The stars add a cool touch and the house looks amazing!  Exceptional picture!  Maybe next time try to not add so much distracting ground in front of the house.', '2008-01-18 14:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402931, 633108, 86191, '<td valign="top">This has a very forest like feel to it.  Its almost like the forest has swallowed the building.  The colors and the angle are amazing!  Great job!</td>', 'This has a very forest like feel to it.  Its almost like the forest has swallowed the building.  The colors and the angle are amazing!  Great job!', '2008-01-18 14:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402937, 632748, 86191, '<td valign="top">This image is really interesting.  I took me a few seconds figure out what it was and my eyes were drawn all over but its an image I could stare at for a long time.  Great job!</td>', 'This image is really interesting.  I took me a few seconds figure out what it was and my eyes were drawn all over but its an image I could stare at for a long time.  Great job!', '2008-01-18 14:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402941, 633746, 86191, '<td valign="top">Alright, good house but in my opinion bad angle.  If you are going to take a picture about a house fading into the forest, have your main focus be on the forest and not on the meadow in front of it.  Good idea though. =]</td>', 'Alright, good house but in my opinion bad angle.  If you are going to take a picture about a house fading into the forest, have your main focus be on the forest and not on the meadow in front of it.  Good idea though. =]', '2008-01-18 15:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402946, 631294, 86191, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha! Who in the world would buy that!? xD Wonderful picture!  It certainly prompts emotion!  I like the angle and how the house blends into the rocks behind it!  The snow adds a great effect! =]  GREAT job!</td>', 'Hahahaha! Who in the world would buy that!? xD Wonderful picture!  It certainly prompts emotion!  I like the angle and how the house blends into the rocks behind it!  The snow adds a great effect! =]  GREAT job!', '2008-01-18 15:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402955, 632485, 80904, '<td valign="top">the place does look old and abandoned</td>', 'the place does look old and abandoned', '2008-01-18 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402956, 633609, 80904, '<td valign="top">nice use of the flash. Makes the textures higlights come out.</td>', 'nice use of the flash. Makes the textures higlights come out.', '2008-01-18 15:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402957, 633220, 80904, '<td valign="top">Nice tone to it, however its a bit cluttered. Then again most abandoned buildings are from the inside. Perhaps an outside shot would have been better IMHO</td>', 'Nice tone to it, however its a bit cluttered. Then again most abandoned buildings are from the inside. Perhaps an outside shot would have been better IMHO', '2008-01-18 15:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402960, 631955, 80904, '<td valign="top">The building is too dark compared to the sky. The left top white is a bit blown out.</td>', 'The building is too dark compared to the sky. The left top white is a bit blown out.', '2008-01-18 15:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402961, 633765, 80904, '<td valign="top">this picture is very cute and sad. Poor little girl</td>', 'this picture is very cute and sad. Poor little girl', '2008-01-18 15:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402965, 631277, 80904, '<td valign="top">Nice castle. It would have had a better effect if it was shot from below and closer, however Im not sure if you were allowed to get close</td>', 'Nice castle. It would have had a better effect if it was shot from below and closer, however Im not sure if you were allowed to get close', '2008-01-18 15:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402970, 633899, 80904, '<td valign="top">a bit dark. It would neat in HDR but its a shame we are doing basic editing</td>', 'a bit dark. It would neat in HDR but its a shame we are doing basic editing', '2008-01-18 15:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402972, 632738, 80904, '<td valign="top">Very metalic cool look. The only gripe woudl be the halo/glow around the house</td>', 'Very metalic cool look. The only gripe woudl be the halo/glow around the house', '2008-01-18 15:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402973, 633154, 80904, '<td valign="top">nice, but the foreground buildings seem dark in contrast to the sky</td>', 'nice, but the foreground buildings seem dark in contrast to the sky', '2008-01-18 15:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402975, 631893, 80904, '<td valign="top">Nice cool looking cementary.</td>', 'Nice cool looking cementary.', '2008-01-18 15:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402977, 633633, 80904, '<td valign="top">nice contrast in this shot.</td>', 'nice contrast in this shot.', '2008-01-18 15:14:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4402979, 631845, 80904, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see less of the foreground and more of the building</td>', 'I would have liked to see less of the foreground and more of the building', '2008-01-18 15:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402984, 632578, 80904, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but the river stands out more than the house. If you had cropped the bottom the house would have stand out more</td>', 'nice shot, but the river stands out more than the house. If you had cropped the bottom the house would have stand out more', '2008-01-18 15:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402993, 633712, 81783, '<td valign="top">The lady looks out of place, like she was cut and pasted into this photo. Not in focus. I think the house by itself would have scored higher.</td>', 'The lady looks out of place, like she was cut and pasted into this photo. Not in focus. I think the house by itself would have scored higher.', '2008-01-18 15:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4402994, 632228, 81783, '<td valign="top">Postcard</td>', 'Postcard', '2008-01-18 15:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403011, 633108, 82064, '<td valign="top">Oooh! I love this one!</td>', 'Oooh! I love this one!', '2008-01-18 15:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403021, 632238, 80904, '<td valign="top">Nice textures. :)</td>', 'Nice textures. :)', '2008-01-18 15:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403025, 633712, 80904, '<td valign="top">Great shot. She looks like she is haunted place</td>', 'Great shot. She looks like she is haunted place', '2008-01-18 15:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403027, 633168, 22390, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why, but I find this image a bit weird. I would say it''s over processed. I like the composition though.</td>', 'I''m not sure why, but I find this image a bit weird. I would say it''s over processed. I like the composition though.', '2008-01-18 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403028, 633131, 80904, '<td valign="top">I think you had the right idea with trying to frame it with the trees and fence, but the DOF seems shallow IMO</td>', 'I think you had the right idea with trying to frame it with the trees and fence, but the DOF seems shallow IMO', '2008-01-18 15:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403029, 633735, 80904, '<td valign="top">IMHO this one would look much more dramatic in B&amp;W</td>', 'IMHO this one would look much more dramatic in B&W', '2008-01-18 15:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403030, 633759, 80904, '<td valign="top">Too dark. I like the window, but I also want to see whats inside the house.</td>', 'Too dark. I like the window, but I also want to see whats inside the house.', '2008-01-18 15:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403033, 632173, 80904, '<td valign="top">Did you use noise reduction? it seems like you did a bit heavy on it.</td>', 'Did you use noise reduction? it seems like you did a bit heavy on it.', '2008-01-18 15:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403034, 633587, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the desolate feel of the sky and the snow, but the centered composition makes this seem far too static</td>', 'i like the desolate feel of the sky and the snow, but the centered composition makes this seem far too static', '2008-01-18 15:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403038, 633656, 67152, '<td valign="top">the centered composition of the chair is extremely unsettling to me - i love it</td>', 'the centered composition of the chair is extremely unsettling to me - i love it', '2008-01-18 15:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403041, 633128, 67152, '<td valign="top">the fog makes the photo - nice work and good find</td>', 'the fog makes the photo - nice work and good find', '2008-01-18 15:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403044, 633109, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent perspective with the welding mask in the foreground, the trash can and blue object to carry us into the scene</td>', 'excellent perspective with the welding mask in the foreground, the trash can and blue object to carry us into the scene', '2008-01-18 15:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403049, 633426, 67152, '<td valign="top">i really like the low key approach to give this one even more grit and desolation</td>', 'i really like the low key approach to give this one even more grit and desolation', '2008-01-18 15:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403050, 633421, 67152, '<td valign="top">what a cool space - i would just like it a bit sharper and a more interesting perspective</td>', 'what a cool space - i would just like it a bit sharper and a more interesting perspective', '2008-01-18 15:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403057, 633609, 208, '<td valign="top">Cool use of the flash on this one. The harsh light works great here.</td>', 'Cool use of the flash on this one. The harsh light works great here.', '2008-01-18 15:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403059, 633204, 208, '<td valign="top">Looks like a good spot for some of the people commenting on my entry!</td>', 'Looks like a good spot for some of the people commenting on my entry!', '2008-01-18 15:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403062, 632228, 80904, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed</td>', 'Nicely framed', '2008-01-18 15:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
