(4403076, 633204, 66597, '<td valign="top">Steve, I hope this is scoring well for you because it shows really well. I would have given it an 8. Great job!</td>', 'Steve, I hope this is scoring well for you because it shows really well. I would have given it an 8. Great job!', '2008-01-18 15:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403077, 633617, 80904, '<td valign="top">Cool angle of the buss. It looks like its from the 60s or 70s</td>', 'Cool angle of the buss. It looks like its from the 60s or 70s', '2008-01-18 15:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403078, 633712, 66597, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary feel to this photo with the ghostly woman and perspective. The blown out sky doesn''t trouble me a bit here. 10.</td>', 'Extraordinary feel to this photo with the ghostly woman and perspective. The blown out sky doesn''t trouble me a bit here. 10.', '2008-01-18 15:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403080, 633131, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene but not quite in focus.</td>', 'Beautiful scene but not quite in focus.', '2008-01-18 15:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403081, 631719, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great use of colors here.</td>', 'Great use of colors here.', '2008-01-18 15:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403082, 633232, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love the angles here but the processing feels a little flat/gray.</td>', 'I love the angles here but the processing feels a little flat/gray.', '2008-01-18 15:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403083, 633406, 66597, '<td valign="top">Cool building - reminds me of Baltimore. Sky looks really grainy though.</td>', 'Cool building - reminds me of Baltimore. Sky looks really grainy though.', '2008-01-18 15:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403084, 633644, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective here. Love the tiny house in the background, too.</td>', 'Very cool perspective here. Love the tiny house in the background, too.', '2008-01-18 15:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403085, 632463, 66597, '<td valign="top">Interesting shadows. Color temp looks a bit cool, but still a great shot.</td>', 'Interesting shadows. Color temp looks a bit cool, but still a great shot.', '2008-01-18 15:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403087, 631475, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great processing on this. I can almost feel the texture.</td>', 'Great processing on this. I can almost feel the texture.', '2008-01-18 15:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403088, 632208, 66597, '<td valign="top">Excellent tonal range here.</td>', 'Excellent tonal range here.', '2008-01-18 15:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403093, 632091, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great scene and old building but looks overexposed.</td>', 'Great scene and old building but looks overexposed.', '2008-01-18 16:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403097, 633645, 22390, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Well done.</td>', 'Good composition. Well done.', '2008-01-18 16:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403100, 633016, 22390, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the building is barely visible.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the building is barely visible.', '2008-01-18 16:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403102, 633796, 22390, '<td valign="top">I think the sky takes to much space in the image.</td>', 'I think the sky takes to much space in the image.', '2008-01-18 16:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403111, 631646, 88796, '<td valign="top">Nice sky!</td>', 'Nice sky!', '2008-01-18 16:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403114, 633662, 88796, '<td valign="top">Cool location! The bright blue sky makes the photo.</td>', 'Cool location! The bright blue sky makes the photo.', '2008-01-18 16:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403115, 632669, 22390, '<td valign="top">I find the image too soft.</td>', 'I find the image too soft.', '2008-01-18 16:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403117, 631750, 88796, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I like everything about it!</td>', 'Nice photo, I like everything about it!', '2008-01-18 16:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403118, 631499, 67258, '<td valign="top">At first glance I completely missed ppreciating the scale and perspective of this photo! A clever idea, and a welcome change from the bulk of the entries in this challenge.  It is a shame that the whites appear blown - they do tend to rather draw the eye.</td>', 'At first glance I completely missed ppreciating the scale and perspective of this photo! A clever idea, and a welcome change from the bulk of the entries in this challenge.  It is a shame that the whites appear blown - they do tend to rather draw the eye.', '2008-01-18 16:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403131, 633761, 73115, '<td valign="top">Is this a doll house? The scuffs and scrapes seem to be in strange places and makes me think its not a full size house. Extra points for making me think. :)</td>', 'Is this a doll house? The scuffs and scrapes seem to be in strange places and makes me think its not a full size house. Extra points for making me think. :)', '2008-01-18 16:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403141, 633112, 73115, '<td valign="top">I hope those are your dogs and not strays or anything.  I suppose though if they were strays they wouldn''t be so close to you. Nice picture.</td>', 'I hope those are your dogs and not strays or anything.  I suppose though if they were strays they wouldn''t be so close to you. Nice picture.', '2008-01-18 16:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403177, 632238, 85451, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what i''m looking at, but I like it =)</td>', 'I have no idea what i''m looking at, but I like it =)', '2008-01-18 17:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403181, 631526, 85451, '<td valign="top">Love this picture. Hope there is more information about it in the description!</td>', 'Love this picture. Hope there is more information about it in the description!', '2008-01-18 17:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403182, 631277, 85451, '<td valign="top">wow where was this taken?</td>', 'wow where was this taken?', '2008-01-18 17:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403186, 633744, 85451, '<td valign="top">The pun suckered me and now I''m voting high</td>', 'The pun suckered me and now I''m voting high', '2008-01-18 17:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403190, 633662, 85451, '<td valign="top">Wow, where was this taken? Consider it faved.</td>', 'Wow, where was this taken? Consider it faved.', '2008-01-18 17:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403193, 633451, 85451, '<td valign="top">Added to favs.</td>', 'Added to favs.', '2008-01-18 17:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403198, 633776, 88796, '<td valign="top">Nice, the blue sky really stands out.  I think all good photos have some sort of contrast between things.  The contrast between the blue sky and the yellow grass is a perfect example of this in your photo. The barn is neutral from the contrasting background and makes it easy to look at, a nice focus point. 10! Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice, the blue sky really stands out.  I think all good photos have some sort of contrast between things.  The contrast between the blue sky and the yellow grass is a perfect example of this in your photo. The barn is neutral from the contrasting background and makes it easy to look at, a nice focus point. 10! Nice shot!', '2008-01-18 17:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403218, 632738, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a striking image but the barn looks like the aspect ratio has been changed.  I''m not sure if it''s just an "illusion" or if the image''s aspect ration has been altered.  The rest of this image is really interesting.</td>', 'This is a striking image but the barn looks like the aspect ratio has been changed.  I''m not sure if it''s just an "illusion" or if the image''s aspect ration has been altered.  The rest of this image is really interesting.', '2008-01-18 18:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403229, 632091, 88704, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but could do with a little more contrast.</td>', 'Nice shot, but could do with a little more contrast.', '2008-01-18 18:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403236, 633192, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot but the colors, particularly the greens, look oversaturated  to me.  Desaturating the greens would make this a very interesting shot.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot but the colors, particularly the greens, look oversaturated  to me.  Desaturating the greens would make this a very interesting shot.', '2008-01-18 18:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403247, 633644, 39679, '<td valign="top">By devoting so much of your image to the space behind the building, you''ve done a great job of giving a sense of loneliness to your shot.  Well done.</td>', 'By devoting so much of your image to the space behind the building, you''ve done a great job of giving a sense of loneliness to your shot.  Well done.', '2008-01-18 18:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403365, 633665, 208, '<td valign="top">I bet this would have been spookier/cooler in black and white or as a duotone.</td>', 'I bet this would have been spookier/cooler in black and white or as a duotone.', '2008-01-18 19:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403384, 632673, 208, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of color to accentuate the cold.</td>', 'Excellent choice of color to accentuate the cold.', '2008-01-18 19:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403403, 633720, 9462, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective, I like how you portray nature reaching to reclaim the land. <br/>A circular polarizer would''ve made for a more dramatic sky.</td>', 'Neat perspective, I like how you portray nature reaching to reclaim the land. A circular polarizer would''ve made for a more dramatic sky.', '2008-01-18 20:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403432, 633708, 69183, '<td valign="top">A lesson in lens distortion. I love it. Great shot!</td>', 'A lesson in lens distortion. I love it. Great shot!', '2008-01-18 20:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403434, 631218, 69183, '<td valign="top">nice. Good use of a person in the shot, works well for me.</td>', 'nice. Good use of a person in the shot, works well for me.', '2008-01-18 20:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403444, 633406, 69183, '<td valign="top">Unusual postprocessing. The colours look like they''ve faded with time and then been over-saturated during a restore/repair of the picture. Or possibly like you get with a cheap postcard or something - not meaning to imply that the photo is cheap, of course. On reflection, I like it :)</td>', 'Unusual postprocessing. The colours look like they''ve faded with time and then been over-saturated during a restore/repair of the picture. Or possibly like you get with a cheap postcard or something - not meaning to imply that the photo is cheap, of course. On reflection, I like it :)', '2008-01-18 20:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403455, 631262, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice sky. The building could be clearer in the detail.</td>', 'Nice sky. The building could be clearer in the detail.', '2008-01-18 20:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403463, 631955, 76335, '<td valign="top">A great subject; would like to have seen it better lit. Nice sky though.</td>', 'A great subject; would like to have seen it better lit. Nice sky though.', '2008-01-18 20:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403520, 633632, 81783, '<td valign="top">Looks very similar to photo in challenge held back in 2005.  //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=163945</td>', 'Looks very similar to photo in challenge held back in 2005.  //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=163945', '2008-01-18 21:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403549, 631475, 87389, '<td valign="top">I really like the texture of building.</td>', 'I really like the texture of building.', '2008-01-18 21:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403597, 633907, 74953, '<td valign="top">REally nice shot and great colors</td>', 'REally nice shot and great colors', '2008-01-18 21:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403635, 633638, 77196, '<td valign="top">too much contrast in lighting between top &amp; bottom of photo.</td>', 'too much contrast in lighting between top & bottom of photo.', '2008-01-18 21:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403644, 632498, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent example of leading lines. Your eye is drawn strongly towards the upper right of the picture. In this photo, it serves to draw the eye away from the foreground to the non-descript background. Try cropping this just past the first rectangle window grill, and see what you think.</td>', 'This is an excellent example of leading lines. Your eye is drawn strongly towards the upper right of the picture. In this photo, it serves to draw the eye away from the foreground to the non-descript background. Try cropping this just past the first rectangle window grill, and see what you think.', '2008-01-18 21:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403646, 631750, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice sky.</td>', 'Very nice sky.', '2008-01-18 21:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403652, 633838, 77196, '<td valign="top">Try a closer crop and see what you think. I love trees, and these are very nice, but they distract from the building.</td>', 'Try a closer crop and see what you think. I love trees, and these are very nice, but they distract from the building.', '2008-01-18 21:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403656, 633080, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting. Try a closer crop on the house. Perhaps shooting it closer, to lose some of the branches obscuring the roof &amp; porch - if that was possible.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting. Try a closer crop on the house. Perhaps shooting it closer, to lose some of the branches obscuring the roof & porch - if that was possible.', '2008-01-18 21:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4403668, 632225, 77196, '<td valign="top">This looks like an entry for Framing. Nice idea, and you''ve done a nice job of framing the shot in the broken window. But, somehow, it takes a non-trivial effort to really see the broken window framing your main subject. I think your added frame is working against you - too wide / heavy and you mentally dismiss the edges because of the heavy frame. A light, white, narrow frame might have served your shot better.</td>', 'This looks like an entry for Framing. Nice idea, and you''ve done a nice job of framing the shot in the broken window. But, somehow, it takes a non-trivial effort to really see the broken window framing your main subject. I think your added frame is working against you - too wide / heavy and you mentally dismiss the edges because of the heavy frame. A light, white, narrow frame might have served your shot better.', '2008-01-18 22:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
