(4406987, 633796, 29477, '<td valign="top">Decent photo...with everyone''s obsession with skies, I would have done some burning and doding in the clouds to add some added punch to the image.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Decent photo...with everyone''s obsession with skies, I would have done some burning and doding in the clouds to add some added punch to the image.  Good Luck.', '2008-01-20 16:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4407200, 633677, 60495, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the house and on the ground around the house adds interest, it almost looks like car lights shining on the house. I thinks leaving the bright lights in the shot on the rigth are a bit distracting though, not sure how it would look with them cropped out. Overall I like it, it kinda has an spooky horror house look to it.</td>', 'The lighting on the house and on the ground around the house adds interest, it almost looks like car lights shining on the house. I thinks leaving the bright lights in the shot on the rigth are a bit distracting though, not sure how it would look with them cropped out. Overall I like it, it kinda has an spooky horror house look to it.', '2008-01-20 18:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
