(4411951, 633582, 86191, '<td valign="top">The coloring looks cool but fake.  There is a glow around the edges of the buildings.  I''m not sure if this was the effect you wanted but it blatantly shows that the image was edited from its original version.  You have a great angle though, I really like how my eyes are drawn out over the sea, almost like I''m looking out of a tower.  Very nice work!</td>', 'The coloring looks cool but fake.  There is a glow around the edges of the buildings.  I''m not sure if this was the effect you wanted but it blatantly shows that the image was edited from its original version.  You have a great angle though, I really like how my eyes are drawn out over the sea, almost like I''m looking out of a tower.  Very nice work!', '2008-01-21 20:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4411974, 633515, 86191, '<td valign="top">Alright, the unfocused barbed wire in the middle of the image is distracting.  You found a nice subject to shoot but I think it would have looked nicer with the barbed wire in focus and the barn not.  In my opinion that would have shown, ''oh look, the barn is run down and sealed off from the world!''  It also would have looked nice without the wire in at all, you have nice contrast with the barn, trees and sky. I love the frost on the roof!  You have a nice image with a great angle just be careful next time what is in front of the subject.</td>', 'Alright, the unfocused barbed wire in the middle of the image is distracting.  You found a nice subject to shoot but I think it would have looked nicer with the barbed wire in focus and the barn not.  In my opinion that would have shown, ''oh look, the barn is run down and sealed off from the world!''  It also would have looked nice without the wire in at all, you have nice contrast with the barn, trees and sky. I love the frost on the roof!  You have a nice image with a great angle just be careful next time what is in front of the subject.', '2008-01-21 20:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
