(4415267, 632544, 83313, '<td valign="top">JPEG police here, please open the door to the suite. Here''s my badge.<br/> <br/>Your image size only takes up less than 2/3 of the allowable file size. I''m not seeing obvious compression artifacts, but that is probably only because of the complexity of the photo. If I look closely I can see evidence of it, however. If you decrease the amount of compression you use when saving your files, it will help the clarity of the images.<br/> <br/>I do like really the idea in this shot, however.</td>', 'JPEG police here, please open the door to the suite. Here''s my badge. Your image size only takes up less than 2/3 of the allowable file size. I''m not seeing obvious compression artifacts, but that is probably only because of the complexity of the photo. If I look closely I can see evidence of it, however. If you decrease the amount of compression you use when saving your files, it will help the clarity of the images. I do like really the idea in this shot, however.', '2008-01-22 22:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
