(4415388, 632644, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great subject, but I think it was a victim of the midday sun, and looks a little washed out. Shooting a little later or earlier in the day will give wonderful details.<br/> <br/>Your file size indicates a little to much JPEG compression as well. That can kill the clarity of an otherwise good shot. Always select a compression ratio that brings your image in as close as possible to the 150 or 200k allowed for a challenge, without going over it.</td>', 'Great subject, but I think it was a victim of the midday sun, and looks a little washed out. Shooting a little later or earlier in the day will give wonderful details. Your file size indicates a little to much JPEG compression as well. That can kill the clarity of an otherwise good shot. Always select a compression ratio that brings your image in as close as possible to the 150 or 200k allowed for a challenge, without going over it.', '2008-01-22 22:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
