(4415800, 633761, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well it''s a shame this scored so low.   I love the sentiment behind the photo.  Interesting creation, great lighting.  Keep entering photos that have meaning to you  :)</td>', 'Well it''s a shame this scored so low.   I love the sentiment behind the photo.  Interesting creation, great lighting.  Keep entering photos that have meaning to you  :)', '2008-01-23 00:08:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415802, 633662, 67237, '<td valign="top">congratulations on this outstanding week!!  2 excellent images : 2 blues!!</td>', 'congratulations on this outstanding week!!  2 excellent images : 2 blues!!', '2008-01-23 00:09:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415818, 631750, 63267, '<td valign="top">This is just awesome! I think you were robbed of a ribbon, but congratulations on the HM!</td>', 'This is just awesome! I think you were robbed of a ribbon, but congratulations on the HM!', '2008-01-23 00:12:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415828, 633154, 67697, '<td valign="top">It''s a sad story, isn''t it?  Love the dark tones, pefect for the mood.  The contrasts on the buildings are excellent and I love how you can see the wear and tear on the roof of the building in the background.</td>', 'It''s a sad story, isn''t it?  Love the dark tones, pefect for the mood.  The contrasts on the buildings are excellent and I love how you can see the wear and tear on the roof of the building in the background.', '2008-01-23 00:15:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415831, 631646, 80904, '<td valign="top">Way to go Judi this shot is beautiful.</td>', 'Way to go Judi this shot is beautiful.', '2008-01-23 00:17:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415832, 633316, 27133, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on third place...about time you got a ribbon!</td>', 'Congratulations on third place...about time you got a ribbon!', '2008-01-23 00:17:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415840, 632208, 67697, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge so I cannot see why this might have scored so low.  This looks great in black and white.  And it looks abandoned to me except for that satellite dish being there lol</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge so I cannot see why this might have scored so low.  This looks great in black and white.  And it looks abandoned to me except for that satellite dish being there lol', '2008-01-23 00:17:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415841, 633662, 59267, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on two blues!</td>', 'Congratulations on two blues!', '2008-01-23 00:17:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415854, 633791, 50034, '<td valign="top">This is typical of me!  I see nice, strong, bold lines &amp; bricks that stagger me with color...because i see life in the macro.  Everybody else seems to see just a boring building!<br/> <br/>When I "pull-back" and look at it "normally," then Yeah!  You''re right!  It''s just a boring building!  but I...am...an...artist...details &amp; repetitions excite me with their power and rhythms.  I just have a different viewpoint on life.  That''s why I''m here...to learn how NT''s think!  :)</td>', 'This is typical of me!  I see nice, strong, bold lines & bricks that stagger me with color...because i see life in the macro.  Everybody else seems to see just a boring building! When I "pull-back" and look at it "normally," then Yeah!  You''re right!  It''s just a boring building!  but I...am...an...artist...details & repetitions excite me with their power and rhythms.  I just have a different viewpoint on life.  That''s why I''m here...to learn how NT''s think!  :)', '2008-01-23 00:18:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415857, 631262, 59267, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!! congratulations on your ribbon!</td>', 'Beautiful!! congratulations on your ribbon!', '2008-01-23 00:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415862, 633316, 59267, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tone and details. Congratulations on your ribbon!</td>', 'Beautiful tone and details. Congratulations on your ribbon!', '2008-01-23 00:20:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415864, 633617, 87538, '<td valign="top">I really am not concerned that your bus might not be considered a building. It was abandoned and had the potential. What matters here to me is your composition and how your photo speaks to me. I like you photo and believe you were unfairly judged.</td>', 'I really am not concerned that your bus might not be considered a building. It was abandoned and had the potential. What matters here to me is your composition and how your photo speaks to me. I like you photo and believe you were unfairly judged.', '2008-01-23 00:20:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415874, 633154, 34462, '<td valign="top">A truly pungent photo and commentary Charlene. Great work!!!</td>', 'A truly pungent photo and commentary Charlene. Great work!!!', '2008-01-23 00:22:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415876, 633785, 67697, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture Deb.  It''s a shame you only got 2 commenters.  But they loved it!  I love the details of wear and decay that you captured.  Keep up your work with the architecture shots - you are really good at those.<br/> <br/>Love,<br/> <br/>Your #1 Fan<br/> <br/>(hehe)</td>', 'Excellent capture Deb.  It''s a shame you only got 2 commenters.  But they loved it!  I love the details of wear and decay that you captured.  Keep up your work with the architecture shots - you are really good at those. Love, Your #1 Fan (hehe)', '2008-01-23 00:23:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415882, 633662, 53814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. You have a subtle, yet distinctive, style of processing that I really like. Congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. You have a subtle, yet distinctive, style of processing that I really like. Congratulations on the ribbon.', '2008-01-23 00:24:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415892, 631218, 34462, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo. Sandy, I think you must have a wonderful job as you get to record the transformation of some truly interesting sites.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wonderful photo. Sandy, I think you must have a wonderful job as you get to record the transformation of some truly interesting sites. ', '2008-01-23 00:27:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415895, 631248, 67697, '<td valign="top">Darn - this would have been perfect for the framing challenge.  I like the crop that you used because it shows that the top is GONE.  Love the light switch too.  Great title as well.  Should have scored higher!</td>', 'Darn - this would have been perfect for the framing challenge.  I like the crop that you used because it shows that the top is GONE.  Love the light switch too.  Great title as well.  Should have scored higher!', '2008-01-23 00:29:20.000000', NULL, 0);
