(4415898, 633662, 28742, '<td valign="top">Traveled over 1000km, stayed there two days, took over a thousand pics - might as well have phoned it in. Next time try and <i>earn</i> the ribbon. :P<br/> <br/>Congrats! Truly a spectacular image and I always love it when that amount of effort pays off.</td>', 'Traveled over 1000km, stayed there two days, took over a thousand pics - might as well have phoned it in. Next time try and earn the ribbon. :P Congrats! Truly a spectacular image and I always love it when that amount of effort pays off.', '2008-01-23 00:30:04.000000', NULL, 0),
