(4415936, 633406, 7073, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes everyone!!  and yes, that is the original color BUT ... the sky did become a bit grainy...  :(<br/>prolly from the uploading -- I didn''t ''web ready'' it.  Maybe that has something to do with it... oh well, my bad!!!  ;-)</td>', 'Thanks for the votes everyone!!  and yes, that is the original color BUT ... the sky did become a bit grainy...  :(prolly from the uploading -- I didn''t ''web ready'' it.  Maybe that has something to do with it... oh well, my bad!!!  ;-)', '2008-01-23 00:39:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4415956, 633662, 47205, '<td valign="top">Well done sir, my fave in the challenge!!! Congrats!!!</td>', 'Well done sir, my fave in the challenge!!! Congrats!!!', '2008-01-23 00:44:44.000000', NULL, 0),
