(4415989, 631218, 69008, '<td valign="top">I love old places like this, and you have a wonderful talent for photographing them. I like the spiral stariway in the back in this as well as the big columns. I am happy for you that you have an occupation that lets you use your talent for something that you enjoy so much.</td>', 'I love old places like this, and you have a wonderful talent for photographing them. I like the spiral stariway in the back in this as well as the big columns. I am happy for you that you have an occupation that lets you use your talent for something that you enjoy so much.', '2008-01-23 01:01:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4416011, 633316, 42013, '<td valign="top">Awesome Jaime! Congrats!</td>', 'Awesome Jaime! Congrats!', '2008-01-23 01:15:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4416020, 633662, 42013, '<td valign="top">1000km?!? I thought driving 250 miles round trip was extreme. Congrats on double dipping this week!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=165919" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/328/120/165919.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/328/120/165919.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/328/120/165919.jpg"/></a> Then... ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-25 02:16:31.</i></td>', '1000km?!? I thought driving 250 miles round trip was extreme. Congrats on double dipping this week!  Then... ;)', '2008-01-23 01:18:26.000000', '2008-01-25 02:16:31.000000', 0),
