(4416245, 633712, 88523, '<td valign="top">again, nice shot!  I thought it would be in the top five, at least in my eyes it is...!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-23 02:39:13.</i></td>', 'again, nice shot!  I thought it would be in the top five, at least in my eyes it is...!', '2008-01-23 02:38:18.000000', '2008-01-23 02:39:13.000000', 0),
