(4416353, 633083, 80908, '<td valign="top">Can I ask (out of curiosity) why you used such a high ISO? I also have a Canon 400D and on the couple of occasions that I have been forced to ISO 1600 (indoor sports / really gloomy wedding etc) the noise has rendered the shots really hard to PP. Outside I would not have thought that it was necessary?<br/> <br/>Cheers!</td>', 'Can I ask (out of curiosity) why you used such a high ISO? I also have a Canon 400D and on the couple of occasions that I have been forced to ISO 1600 (indoor sports / really gloomy wedding etc) the noise has rendered the shots really hard to PP. Outside I would not have thought that it was necessary? Cheers!', '2008-01-23 03:46:39.000000', NULL, 0),
