(4416918, 632173, 73234, '<td valign="top">Well, this was a surprise.  I uploaded the wrong image for the contest, and since I''m fairly new around here, I figured I''d just deal with it and see how this one did.  It looks sort of blurry because it''s a long exposure at twilight, and most of the light coming in was from cars passing on the street out front, which gives everything a softer look.<br/> <br/>The one I meant to post is here: <a href="//www.smugmug.com/gallery/4163592/1/243284424#243285021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.smugmug.com/gallery/4163592/1/243284424#243285021</a> <br/> <br/>Anyway, thanks for the comments.</td>', 'Well, this was a surprise.  I uploaded the wrong image for the contest, and since I''m fairly new around here, I figured I''d just deal with it and see how this one did.  It looks sort of blurry because it''s a long exposure at twilight, and most of the light coming in was from cars passing on the street out front, which gives everything a softer look. The one I meant to post is here: //www.smugmug.com/gallery/4163592/1/243284424#243285021  Anyway, thanks for the comments.', '2008-01-23 09:04:13.000000', NULL, 0),
