(4417609, 633590, 67152, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I can''t believe the nasty score on this one Alan. The voters were sure grumpy.  I like the simple composition and the layers and textures created by the door, the bricks and how the graffitti leads us to the bare lamp.  I didn''t get to vote on this one, but I would have easily given this a 7.</td>', 'Wow!  I can''t believe the nasty score on this one Alan. The voters were sure grumpy.  I like the simple composition and the layers and textures created by the door, the bricks and how the graffitti leads us to the bare lamp.  I didn''t get to vote on this one, but I would have easily given this a 7.', '2008-01-23 11:58:23.000000', NULL, 0),
