(4417626, 633316, 30861, '<td valign="top">Just reeks of abandonment, doesn''t it? Congrats on first ribbon!</td>', 'Just reeks of abandonment, doesn''t it? Congrats on first ribbon!', '2008-01-23 12:01:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4417735, 632148, 88479, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glencoppersmith:</b></div><hr/><i> What is the toxic green leaking down from above? I sure hope it''s just a mis-step with your levels, because otherwise the Hudson must be getting dirtier than even when I lived there! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Weird, no levels were adjusted for this.  All I did was resize and usm (I didn''t even need to crop it).<br/> <br/>Basically the building itself looks like it used to be covered in a lot of soot from when the area used to be filled with factories bilging out smoke.  Since then a lot of it has got washed away with time, leaving lots of interesting patterns in the brickwork.<br/>I think the green flecks are just moss and grasses growing through the brickwork (that is the only green I see).<br/> <br/>It was taken pretty early in the morning (around 8am I think) with very bright sun low in the sky to try and maximize it''s features.</td>', 'Originally posted by glencoppersmith: What is the toxic green leaking down from above? I sure hope it''s just a mis-step with your levels, because otherwise the Hudson must be getting dirtier than even when I lived there!  Weird, no levels were adjusted for this.  All I did was resize and usm (I didn''t even need to crop it). Basically the building itself looks like it used to be covered in a lot of soot from when the area used to be filled with factories bilging out smoke.  Since then a lot of it has got washed away with time, leaving lots of interesting patterns in the brickwork.I think the green flecks are just moss and grasses growing through the brickwork (that is the only green I see). It was taken pretty early in the morning (around 8am I think) with very bright sun low in the sky to try and maximize it''s features.', '2008-01-23 12:37:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4417779, 633712, 51538, '<td valign="top">That building has a lot of potential!</td>', 'That building has a lot of potential!', '2008-01-23 12:50:12.000000', NULL, 0),
