(4423413, 631646, 34938, '<td valign="top">Wow Judi, this is beautiful...you have been really churning out some magnificent work of late...you are in a real purple patch despite the floods up there and any other challenges...you know I am a Pastor, so I will leave you with a personal Bible verse to say I am thinking about and praying for you and fellow Queenslanders:<br/> <br/>Isaiah 43:1-3 (The Message Translation)<br/> <br/>This is what the Lord says:<br/>"Don''t be afraid, I''ve redeemed you. <br/>   I''ve called your name. You''re mine.<br/>When you''re in over your head, I''ll be there with you. <br/> <b>When you''re in rough waters, you will not go down.</b> <br/>When you''re between a rock and a hard place, <br/>   it won''t be a dead end<br/>Because I am God, your personal God, <br/>I paid a huge price for you: <br/>  That''s how much you mean to me! <br/>   That''s how much I love you!<br/>I''d sell off the whole world to get you back, <br/>   trade the creation just for you."<br/> <br/>Praying for you - Enzo</td>', 'Wow Judi, this is beautiful...you have been really churning out some magnificent work of late...you are in a real purple patch despite the floods up there and any other challenges...you know I am a Pastor, so I will leave you with a personal Bible verse to say I am thinking about and praying for you and fellow Queenslanders: Isaiah 43:1-3 (The Message Translation) This is what the Lord says:"Don''t be afraid, I''ve redeemed you.    I''ve called your name. You''re mine.When you''re in over your head, I''ll be there with you.  When you''re in rough waters, you will not go down. When you''re between a rock and a hard place,    it won''t be a dead endBecause I am God, your personal God, I paid a huge price for you:   That''s how much you mean to me!    That''s how much I love you!I''d sell off the whole world to get you back,    trade the creation just for you." Praying for you - Enzo', '2008-01-25 00:51:50.000000', NULL, 0),
