(4427343, 633575, 23141, '<td valign="top">Darnit, I even did my research to make sure that dodging and burning was okay.  I really thought it was (obviously, or I''d not have put it in my notes).  Thanks to everyone who commented!</td>', 'Darnit, I even did my research to make sure that dodging and burning was okay.  I really thought it was (obviously, or I''d not have put it in my notes).  Thanks to everyone who commented!', '2008-01-26 20:44:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4427401, 633662, 8610, '<td valign="top">djöfull ertu klikkaður, fórstu alla leið vestur á Horn fyrir þessa keppni. Ég myndi segja að það væri afar hressandi<br/>Eru nú allar góðar þarna hjá þér, finnst eiginlega þessi síst, en góð er hún. Til lukku</td>', 'djöfull ertu klikkaður, fórstu alla leið vestur á Horn fyrir þessa keppni. Ég myndi segja að það væri afar hressandiEru nú allar góðar þarna hjá þér, finnst eiginlega þessi síst, en góð er hún. Til lukku', '2008-01-26 21:25:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4427733, 633316, 77196, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon and first 7! Very nice shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon and first 7! Very nice shot.', '2008-01-27 00:03:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4428850, 633662, 73980, '<td valign="top">Definitely a beautiful shot!  Congratulations!</td>', 'Definitely a beautiful shot!  Congratulations!', '2008-01-27 12:58:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4429901, 633662, 51538, '<td valign="top">Interesting geology there.  Well worth the trip.  Is that a basalt sill outcrop along the top of the scree?  There are so many fascinating views in your country.</td>', 'Interesting geology there.  Well worth the trip.  Is that a basalt sill outcrop along the top of the scree?  There are so many fascinating views in your country.', '2008-01-27 19:18:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4430480, 633712, 73980, '<td valign="top">Way overexposed night shot....  that ended up with fantastic, eerie results.  Perfect for the subject.  I do a lot of night work, too and love it as well.</td>', 'Way overexposed night shot....  that ended up with fantastic, eerie results.  Perfect for the subject.  I do a lot of night work, too and love it as well.', '2008-01-27 22:46:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4430539, 633645, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully artistic shot.</td>', 'Wonderfully artistic shot.', '2008-01-27 23:08:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4430557, 633632, 88902, '<td valign="top">This building is Hideous.<br/> <br/>You''ve made it gorgeous, on both submissions.. A+ Work!</td>', 'This building is Hideous. You''ve made it gorgeous, on both submissions.. A+ Work!', '2008-01-27 23:15:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4430798, 633580, 66384, '<td valign="top">Marvelous. How did you get the clouds to radiate out from the barn like that? :) I love the very soft colors of this shot and the gentle contrast. Nice going to resist the DPC influence of contrasty, over-saturated images. And it scored well in spite of that. Congratulations.</td>', 'Marvelous. How did you get the clouds to radiate out from the barn like that? :) I love the very soft colors of this shot and the gentle contrast. Nice going to resist the DPC influence of contrasty, over-saturated images. And it scored well in spite of that. Congratulations.', '2008-01-28 00:31:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4430938, 633785, 65319, '<td valign="top">Wonderful crisp sharpness and detail!</td>', 'Wonderful crisp sharpness and detail!', '2008-01-28 00:51:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431120, 633428, 53964, '<td valign="top">Hey, 71% isn''t that shabby :)</td>', 'Hey, 71% isn''t that shabby :)', '2008-01-28 01:24:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431418, 633760, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lisa<br/> <br/>Great job on catching the dereliction of this building so well.  I love the sharpness of the broken window panes.  A super textured image</td>', 'Lisa Great job on catching the dereliction of this building so well.  I love the sharpness of the broken window panes.  A super textured image', '2008-01-28 03:51:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4431421, 631526, 30982, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo!  You captured the snow!  I missed it by two days.  :-(  Cool shot and very appropriate use of the fisheye.  And very nice of the sky to cooperate for you too!  Doesn''t happen often there.  Oh, and edit to add at least no one thought this was mine this time.  :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-28 03:55:26.</i></td>', 'Woo hoo!  You captured the snow!  I missed it by two days.  :-(  Cool shot and very appropriate use of the fisheye.  And very nice of the sky to cooperate for you too!  Doesn''t happen often there.  Oh, and edit to add at least no one thought this was mine this time.  :)', '2008-01-28 03:54:39.000000', '2008-01-28 03:55:26.000000', 0),
(4432102, 633316, 89418, '<td valign="top">This picture is amazing.</td>', 'This picture is amazing.', '2008-01-28 09:54:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432111, 633726, 89419, '<td valign="top">doesnt seemed focused</td>', 'doesnt seemed focused', '2008-01-28 09:55:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432119, 633678, 89425, '<td valign="top">i really like the color. it sort of gives a more creative tone to vandalism.<br/></td>', 'i really like the color. it sort of gives a more creative tone to vandalism.', '2008-01-28 09:56:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432121, 631262, 89418, '<td valign="top">This photo feels as if it black and white but has a ton of color at the same time. Amazing job.</td>', 'This photo feels as if it black and white but has a ton of color at the same time. Amazing job.', '2008-01-28 09:57:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432125, 633334, 89425, '<td valign="top">nice angle, really like the contrasting blue sky.</td>', 'nice angle, really like the contrasting blue sky.', '2008-01-28 09:57:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432126, 632919, 89419, '<td valign="top">nice photo i like the angle but there is to much of the sky in photo</td>', 'nice photo i like the angle but there is to much of the sky in photo', '2008-01-28 09:57:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432147, 631661, 89419, '<td valign="top">i dont like the fence its distracting but i like everything else</td>', 'i dont like the fence its distracting but i like everything else', '2008-01-28 10:00:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4432535, 631218, 67697, '<td valign="top">I came here looking for your BEST OF pic and did not see one :(  So I will comment on this one that I missed!  I love this fun and ghostly photo.  You gave the viewer a little something more to look at besides the structure.  I have to say I love those stairs leading away on the right.  Makes me wonder where they go.</td>', 'I came here looking for your BEST OF pic and did not see one :(  So I will comment on this one that I missed!  I love this fun and ghostly photo.  You gave the viewer a little something more to look at besides the structure.  I have to say I love those stairs leading away on the right.  Makes me wonder where they go.', '2008-01-28 11:32:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4433477, 631248, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  This is just too funny!  I love the light switch.  Quite nicely reinforces the whole abandoned building thing, but the best part, of course, are the cows.</td>', 'LOL!  This is just too funny!  I love the light switch.  Quite nicely reinforces the whole abandoned building thing, but the best part, of course, are the cows.', '2008-01-28 14:52:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4433620, 632000, 85981, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the the comments folks.<br/>I''m really just getting the hang of the camera now. I bought a spyder monitor calibrator over the weekend, and after calibration, I realise how muted the colours are.<br/>I had tried a few different crops and decided to leave the old slate roof in shot, only because the chimney flue is actually tied on with parcel twine, the compression needed to make it entry sized removed that detail.<br/> <br/>I''m going to play with it more since the monitor calibration, the red and blue should be alot stronger.<br/> <br/>As an aside, I took this shot on a Saturday for the competition. The building has been derelict for at least 10 years. I passed by it on the way home from work on the following Monday only to see a skip (dumpster) outside it and workmen leaving.</td>', 'Thanks for the the comments folks.I''m really just getting the hang of the camera now. I bought a spyder monitor calibrator over the weekend, and after calibration, I realise how muted the colours are.I had tried a few different crops and decided to leave the old slate roof in shot, only because the chimney flue is actually tied on with parcel twine, the compression needed to make it entry sized removed that detail. I''m going to play with it more since the monitor calibration, the red and blue should be alot stronger. As an aside, I took this shot on a Saturday for the competition. The building has been derelict for at least 10 years. I passed by it on the way home from work on the following Monday only to see a skip (dumpster) outside it and workmen leaving.', '2008-01-28 15:14:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4435346, 631661, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is way better than a 4.6 .. i really like the oof wire .. it gives an interesting feeling to the photograph .. nearly voyeuristic .. loving the ''x'' .. the colours are excellent and so is that sign there .. ''no trespassing'' .. <br/>it really is a bloody shame when somthing really good does so badly .. :)</td>', 'this is way better than a 4.6 .. i really like the oof wire .. it gives an interesting feeling to the photograph .. nearly voyeuristic .. loving the ''x'' .. the colours are excellent and so is that sign there .. ''no trespassing'' .. it really is a bloody shame when somthing really good does so badly .. :)', '2008-01-29 00:05:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4435869, 631262, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey karen .. fantastic photograph .. that sky is amazing .. congratulations on your ribbon and this excellent addition to your profile page .. :)</td>', 'hey karen .. fantastic photograph .. that sky is amazing .. congratulations on your ribbon and this excellent addition to your profile page .. :)', '2008-01-29 08:20:11.000000', NULL, 0),
